{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-engineering","title":"平台工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tenant-lifecycle-management","title":"租户生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/tenant-lifecycle-management","wordCount":1265,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-quota-fairness","title":"资源配额与公平性保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/resource-quota-fairness","wordCount":1304,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"tenant-aware-observability","title":"租户感知可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/tenant-aware-observability","wordCount":1226,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 平台工程\n\n本章从平台团队的视角审视多租户系统的运营层面。数据隔离只是起点——一个成熟的多租户平台还需要解决租户的完整生命周期管理、资源配额与公平性保障、以及租户感知的可观测性体系。\n\n三篇文档覆盖平台工程的三大支柱：生命周期管理处理租户从创建到销毁的全流程自动化；资源配额与公平性解决「吵闹邻居」问题和计量计费；租户感知可观测性让运维团队能以租户为粒度诊断问题。\n\n完成本章后，读者应能设计一套完整的租户运营平台，支撑从 onboarding 到 offboarding 的自动化流程，并在运行时保证租户间的资源公平与问题可追溯。\n"}